cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "MeloLingua CEFR-Graded Multilingual Stories Dataset"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "MeloLingua"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-27
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/MeloLingua/melolingua-language-stories-dataset"
url: "https://melolingua.com"
abstract: >-
  A public educational corpus of 118 A1-B2 graded stories in German, Spanish,
  French, Italian, Korean, and Russian, with sentence-aligned English
  translations, contextual vocabulary, comprehension questions,
  sentence-building exercises, teaching metadata, and source provenance.
keywords:
  - graded readers
  - language learning
  - multilingual dataset
  - CEFR
  - parallel text
  - reading comprehension
  - educational technology
  - natural language processing
